msgstr ":ref:`电池失控保护说明请参见此处 <apms-failsafe-function>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:79
#: b6962b38dddb4a1fb4450fc91d010c41
msgid "Extending Current Measurement Capacity"
msgstr "扩展电流测量范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:81
#: 1cfcaca684324e7483ccb908b8fb8676
msgid ""
"Shunt resistor power monitors of this variety can be used to measure higher "
"currents if setup in a current sharing configuration, as shown below:"
msgstr "此类分流电阻电源监测器可通过电流分流配置来测量更大电流，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:86
#: 4b592f0c10a840f6a4a3408a2f431829
msgid "Design points:"
msgstr "设计要点："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:88
#: 0cf297c972b946b39731e1febd34162a
msgid ""
"The shunt should be approximately the same resistance as the power module. "
"For example, a 120A module usually uses a 0.5 milliohm sense resistor. "
"Therefore the wire shunt should be ~ 0.5 milliohm for equal sharing of the "
"total current. This can be determined from a reference such as `this "
"<https://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/wire-gauges-d_419.html>`_ . For 12ga "
"wire, that would be ~ 4 inches."
msgstr ""
"分流线应与电源模块的电阻大致相同。例如，120A 模块通常使用 0.5 毫欧感应电阻，因此分流线阻值应约为 0.5 毫欧以实现电流均分。可参考 `此表 "
"<https://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/wire-gauges-d_419.html>`_ 确定。对于 12 号线，约 "
"4 英寸。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:89
#: 143ad81f0bbc42618e624b8c93030e5f
msgid ""
"The wire gauge (and, of course, the wire used to connect the power module) "
"should be rated to handle the expected continuous current for the length of "
"wiring utilized."
msgstr "导线规格（以及连接电源模块所用导线）应能承受所用线长下的预期持续电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:90
#: 998a06f978364d6399b1aace8443bae9
msgid ""
"Try to keep the leads from the shunt junctions to power module short. Longer"
" leads to the module there will increase resistance in that branch. This "
"will unbalance the current split. Not an large issue, but will effectively "
"increase the max resistance capability and decrease the incremental "
"sensitivity of the measurement more than needed."
msgstr ""
"尽量缩短分流节点到电源模块的引线长度。较长的引线会增加该支路阻值，导致电流分配不均。这不是大问题，但会有效增大最大可测电阻值，并降低测量精度超过所需程度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:96
#: 900e453a2a5c40369d8ba11a12f5bd74
msgid ""
"In the photo above, by providing two bypasses, the current is shared such "
"that the power monitor sees a little less than 1/3 the total current "
"flowing, and reports a value ~1/3 normal, extending its range ~3X."
msgstr "上图中通过提供两条旁路，使电流分配为电源监测器仅检测到总电流的略低于 1/3，报告值约为正常值的 1/3，将量程扩展约 3 倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:98
#: c41b0c0396ed474e8c7de3bc5be1953b
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Due to variations in materials, length, etc. it is mandatory that the "
"monitor be calibrated using a precision current meter of some kind. It is "
"best to calibrate at a value greater than 50% of the maximum current "
"expected."
msgstr "由于材料、长度等因素存在差异，必须使用某种精密电流计对监测器进行校准。最好在高于预期最大电流 50% 的电流值下进行校准。"
